 "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n私のFF14のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\n彼女は穏やかで優しいお姉さんの様なキャラクターです。\n\n■資料\nhttps://imgur.com/a/6xfmRQV\n\n構図やポーズにつきましてはお任せいたします。\n\n何卒ご検討の程よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thx_r308/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4cd2a59b/uploads/origins/11bf79c7-191c-4dfa-a6c4-abb20d78ac33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5999b2690ff887600b99157da4fb276", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4cd2a59b/uploads/origins/11bf79c7-191c-4dfa-a6c4-abb20d78ac33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5999b2690ff887600b99157da4fb276, https://si.imgix.net/4cd2a59b/uploads/origins/11bf79c7-191c-4dfa-a6c4-abb20d78ac33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d21d274d263eba20cdfb2cecc03600a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4cd2a59b/uploads/origins/11bf79c7-191c-4dfa-a6c4-abb20d78ac33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=407afcc68f1b68b520aff817898c21cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Yu-dachi様初めまして。\nいつも素敵なイラストと楽曲を拝見拝聴しています。\n\n何時も描いてらっしゃるふわふわ系の悪魔っ子のイラストを見て、是非描いて欲しいと思いリクエストに来ました。\n\n描いて欲しいキャラクターは以下の特徴です。\n・銀髪青眼\n・悪魔系の2本ツノあり　https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/99716088　のような形状\n・前髪含めてグラブルのリッチやブルアカのアリスのような長髪\n・黒の裾長のドレス　https://img.finalfantasyxiv.com/t/1a9ca03082c00c373e45a4c72dfc30d06c45bff5_0.jpg?1592555513　\n・体型はグラブルのリッチやブルアカのイオリぐらいで、胸はあるとは言えないがないとも言えない\n・自分の体より大きい鎌を持ってる\n\n参考画像が少なく恐縮なのですが、是非Yu-daichi様のデザインセンスと絵柄で描いて欲しいと思いました。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thx_r308/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a1a5e83b/uploads/origins/679d2410-b911-4c65-9cdf-4286d8ca5219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550354ac2fcc813f5468683a24284a15", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a1a5e83b/uploads/origins/679d2410-b911-4c65-9cdf-4286d8ca5219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550354ac2fcc813f5468683a24284a15, https://si.imgix.net/a1a5e83b/uploads/origins/679d2410-b911-4c65-9cdf-4286d8ca5219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0646490c547f0e3e6975869bcdf72e55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a1a5e83b/uploads/origins/679d2410-b911-4c65-9cdf-4286d8ca5219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed916258c34c0acc4fad08b273798bae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I found your art on twitter and like quite a bit, as well as your music. \n\nI was hoping I could reach out to you about a commission for my OC. I wanted to make some changes to her. I was changing her up a bit, and I love having artist point their spin on things, but the OC has ended up getting a bit \"lewder\" than I intended. I'd like to see you vision of it and I just wanted to change two things, her horns, to be like some on the reference and the skirt, as that was the main part that got very revealing. \n\nI like the \"flowy-ness\" of 2B's skirt from nier, so something like that I would like a lot. \nThis is my first time using Skeb to, so I apologize if I messed anything up. :^)\n\nhttps://media.discordapp.net/attachments/745365682816024694/894623518896033842/unknown.png?width=758&height=774", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thx_r308/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=26f9323ece0f1c1643d6b2a75bf8d4e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=26f9323ece0f1c1643d6b2a75bf8d4e2, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=62ab57ea080c59475996088c1fd98807 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f4bc2bcae6ec0bd5ee226f3e5fab4730 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@thx_r308/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6f12e334804d738d4d212a7f30b314b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6f12e334804d738d4d212a7f30b314b, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c822c52e1d6939d09f57c6ddd4af28d 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1755498985085865984%2FndHVpWvb.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed96bbc216292e28a1f54d5082afe008 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、月影楼と申します。\n他の方の納品で素敵な音楽をお聴きし、リクをお送りいたしました。\n私のオリジナルキャラ2名を描いたイラスト（制作済み）のシーンに合うBGM曲をリクエストします。\n\nイラストは下記URLの通りで、雪が降る静かな温泉街を二人で寄り添って歩く・・・というシーンです。\nゆったりした時間が流れるような和風の感じだと嬉しいです。\n※自分個人用に音楽と